        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/v/bbe5ce/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2015-01-30T12:37:09.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Is there anywhere you can get hero, villain and environment cards like the ones in the mini-expansions? I realised the other day how neat it was to be able to hand a new player something that gives them the bio for the hero, putting the lore in the box and save on passing round the rulebooks. Not sure how they could take promo cards in to account though</p>",
