        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/m/c6cbf5/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2015-01-30T14:47:35.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Not that I know of, but these ought to be a thing. Homebrewing something would be fairly straightforward but enormously time consuming. They would also be a great way to randomly select heroes without requiring an app to hand, I tried using the character cards in this way but it just made things awkward when people want to choose from the box.</p>",
