        "created_at": "2015-01-30T15:37:42.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I don't much care for them myself; just another thing to keep track of (that I still want to keep around). And for OCD's sake, I wish the first six mini-expansions were like the blister pack cards.</p><p>I keep all of my rulebooks and character supplement inserts if I want to know more about them and their difficulties/complexities, so that does the trick.</p>",
