      {
        "id": 129812,
        "name": "ViolentSilence",
        "username": "ViolentSilence",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/v/bbe5ce/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2015-01-30T16:23:43.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"jsz2\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n jsz2:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>You could print out the wiki bios and use those. One problem there is that promos generally have an entirely seperate page, it it's still doable.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>It was just neat being able to hand someone the card when they were interested in Unity, to give them a sense of the character. Printing the wikis would work, it just would add a lot more paper to the box. For people familiar with the lore, these are far from essential, so I won't be shocked if there is a lack of interest in the cards, it just appealed to the ex-roleplayer side of me</p>",
