      {
        "id": 129814,
        "name": "MightySi",
        "username": "MightySi",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mightysi/{size}/2168_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-01-30T17:21:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I liked the cards that came with Unity and Ambuscade and wouldn't be opposed to the a 'deck' of bio cards being available for past heroes and bios coming with the new ones as they get published. &nbsp;Make the deck bigger and give us Villain ones too. &nbsp;Both for the main guys and the folks that pop up on nemesis cards like Tantrum and The Crackjaw Crew.</p><p>The promo cards could also come with one as a bio-update type thing. &nbsp;What makes Rook City Wraith different? &nbsp;Why is she RookCitying at this point in her career. &nbsp;Why is Engine Of War Bunker a different dude? &nbsp;That kind of thing.</p><p>Edit : It's just occured to me that what I actually want is an A-Z of the Multiverse. &nbsp;Probably too big for bio cards. I'll see myself out ;)</p>",
        "post_number": 8,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:04:49.076Z",
