        "read": false,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>I liked the cards that came with Unity and Ambuscade and wouldn&#39;t be opposed to the a &#39;deck&#39; of bio cards being available for past heroes and bios coming with the new ones as they get published. &nbsp;Make the deck bigger and give us Villain ones too. &nbsp;Both for the main guys and the folks that pop up on nemesis cards like Tantrum and The Crackjaw Crew.</p><p>The promo cards could also come with one as a bio-update type thing. &nbsp;What makes Rook City Wraith different? &nbsp;Why is she RookCitying at this point in her career. &nbsp;Why is Engine Of War Bunker a different dude? &nbsp;That kind of thing.</p><p>Edit : It&#39;s just occured to me that what I actually want is an A-Z of the Multiverse. &nbsp;Probably too big for bio cards. I&#39;ll see myself out ;)</p>",
